{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/extras/88b5f2e29affbadd7557259b21b48ee5.poster.avif?t=1750428330\" width=580 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/extras/88b5f2e29affbadd7557259b21b48ee5.webm?t=1750428330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/extras/88b5f2e29affbadd7557259b21b48ee5.mp4?t=1750428330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The Blind Prophet</strong> is a Point'n'Click game where you will play apostle Bartholomeus in his divine mission: liberate the corrupted city of Rotbork, and brave the Great Evil that lurks within.<br>Although he's used to execute his duty, it won't be as easy as it should be this time ... <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Free exploration in 99 hand-drawed panels, with tiny details waiting for you to discover it<br></li><li>A strong storyline, but not without humor!<br></li><li>Unique comic book art-style experience<br></li><li>Various puzzles, challenges and mini-games for a diverse experience.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/extras/e73d921c84a755848150feba75ce9941.avif?t=1750428330\" width=600 height=251 /></span><br><br><strong>The Blind Prophet - Blood of the Apostle</strong> inherits from well-known point'n'Click games while trying to propose something fresh in substance and format.<br><br>If you like to play point'n'Click games the simple way, and want to experience an animated narrative story with contemplation and reflexion, you will enjoy this game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/extras/c5fcf04ded9ec012120d49f2008bee95.avif?t=1750428330\" width=600 height=251 /></span><br><br>Inspired from games such as Blade Runner, Broken Sword series or Gabriel Knight, the game builds its foundation on a strong storyline, a sense of fluidity and a darkly pleasing ambiance.<br>Use your sagacity and intelligence to defeat traps, hunt demons and destroy their diabolical ways. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/extras/4ff6b33832e624812e0575747acdaa04.poster.avif?t=1750428330\" width=580 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/extras/4ff6b33832e624812e0575747acdaa04.webm?t=1750428330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/968370?t=1750428330","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/968370?t=1750428330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750428330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750428330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains an attempted rape scene"},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/extras/88b5f2e29affbadd7557259b21b48ee5.poster.avif?t=1750428330\" width=580 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968370/extras/88b5f2e29affbadd7557259b21b48ee5.webm?t=1750428330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto